    "title": "StoryFont for Instagram Story",
    "description": "with StoryFont app now it's possible to use ANY fonts in your Instagram Stories ! Just write your text in the application and add it directly to your Instagram story.\r\n\r\n- More than 300 Fonts. include English,Arabic,Turkish,Hindi and Farsi fonts.\r\n- Pin favorite fonts on top of the fonts list.\r\n- Multiple backgrounds effect include brush and dialogue box !\r\n- You can change font & color of only part of text\r\n- More than 6 text backgrounds\r\n\r\nSupported Languages:\r\n\r\n- English\r\n- Arabic\r\n- Farsi\r\n- Turkish\r\n- Chinese\r\n- Korean\r\n- Japanese\r\n- Thai\r\n- Russian\r\n\r\n\r\n* Story Font works with images and gifs , you can use final result on any app such as WhatsApp,Telegram & etc. BUT we Improved this App for Instagram Story! so it's better to use it only for Instagram Story. We suggest to use it for Instagram.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://cutt.ly/9jy938s\r\nTerms & Conditions: https://cutt.ly/Wjy97ce",
